  <item>
    <title>127. 再见青春｜听说青旅不让35+的人住了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691ad1aecbba038b42ed308a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691ad1aecbba038b42ed308a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>聊聊我们的青旅故事，以及最近的青旅争议</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 青旅拒绝35岁以上的人住宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 一线城市青旅一晚50块，价格极其亲民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> 青年旅舍的初始概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 青旅逐渐退出历史舞台，变成中登回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 青旅已经从年轻人的理想变成生活上的捷径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 相比较与青年，现在的中年人反而是消费主力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a> 如何破解青旅现在的营销困境？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 三十五岁的中年人好惨</span></p>]]></description>
