  <item>
    <title>126. 一场山西婚礼，读懂乡土中国</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69103e7eaf4fc00da7d6b8fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69103e7eaf4fc00da7d6b8fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录这期节目的时候，Lily刚刚办完了在山西的第一场婚礼。这次婚礼Lily体验非常好，但坦诚说也有不小的文化冲击，感觉很开眼界，于是有了这期和资深山西人食欲的讨论。结婚这样的大型家族仪式，其实是一个最好的窥见民风民俗的窗口，当地的社会观和经济观可以一览无余。</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>此外其实Lily还办了一场在北京的、100%是同龄人朋友的婚礼，非常温馨欢乐，而且花了非常少的预算，超级省钱！</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ndFBzVd6iAcE0WW0ruTb8g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ndFBzVd6iAcE0WW0ruTb8g"><span>可以点击这里查看～</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 山西结婚不仅是经济账还是人情账！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 对于城市人来说，在地方有文化冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 在乡土中国你不结婚或者不要小孩是一种管理单元的失控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 在山西结婚，可以感受到最纯粹的乡土中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> Lily在自己的婚礼现场从天而降~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 山西婚礼的流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 结婚前一天的特殊仪式 吃了32个饺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 帮叔叔婶婶来滚床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">42:59</a> 大家对乡土中国式的婚礼有什么看法呢？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lpyXrW3QXjPUquda3g74M8w46a6w.m4a" length="42562372" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDNJLZqZGTmDCaoeZJ4uaJCZk2k.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>126</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>125. 如何拥有超强心力？养好你的内在小孩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690802cf43a4f4a984998f32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690802cf43a4f4a984998f32</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Nov 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>越长大越发现心力是一件重要的事，职业发展、生活推进，都需要内在力量的支持。本期我们来聊聊那些看似成熟，实则没有长大的人，为什么会这样，以及如何从内到外成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听众群：微信搜 wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 很多人看起来是成年人的年龄，但是却是小孩的内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 遇到问题，你是向外看还是向内看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 内心力量不足的人，很难面对新困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 被过度保护的孩子，成年后很难社会化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 内在小孩如何成长？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 独立的人会吸引内在小孩向他们靠拢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 成为成年人的第一步，不要后悔自己走的每一步路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 内心力量比较弱的人，内心壁垒也很薄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 狗狗也是有原生家庭创伤的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 我们没有办法决定我们的土壤，但可以决定如何生长</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lkg6Ch-uVdgv3Ex3C6U9WaXSGk5N.m4a" length="46543072" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDNJLZqZGTmDCaoeZJ4uaJCZk2k.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>125</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>124. 欧洲旅行｜在最松弛的法国比利时，走出最特种兵的步伐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fec17401567203212774f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fec17401567203212774f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期来分享我们的欧洲旅行故事～十一假期Lily刚刚去了比利时&amp;法国度蜜月，食欲在留学期间也在这两个国家生活和游玩过，闺蜜的脚步在异乡的街头跨时空重合了～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期包含布鲁塞尔、布鲁日、巴黎、阿维尼翁、马赛五个城市，如果想了解更多关于这些城市的信息，也欢迎加入听友群！</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友群：wolongfengchu818 （微信搜索）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 欧洲旅行是要不停走路的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 巴黎如果想玩好的话最起码需要玩半个月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a> 欧洲人的效率低的不像活在21世纪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 家人们，欧洲旅行也要看淡旺季！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 12欧英国飞到奥地利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 布鲁塞尔 i人天堂 E人地狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 传出去，英国留学真不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 比利时人做饭竟然比法国人更加好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 巴黎的浪漫，名不虚传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 穷游富游，不如少年游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a> 爱在黎明破晓前</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lsiiFA0_v6mI4HTS5M-hVirnS0zA.m4a" length="52981254" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVSjVJ2R9mV2rLQJskysrxsO25L.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>124</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>123. 博主告诉你：双11怎么买更省钱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f4907c22654730202e5b81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f4907c22654730202e5b81</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年一度双十一！今年食欲会从博主的角度来讲讲怎么买最省钱！本期全程无广，可放心收听～</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入卧龙凤雏听友群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> &nbsp;贵价夏季商务服装经典款、夏季美利奴羊毛T恤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> &nbsp;高端中秋月饼平替日常小甜点（618我会囤端午粽子）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> &nbsp;开年年货，有2025日历的笔记本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> &nbsp;马上出新品的手机，往往上一代会大跳水，但实际上性能依然很能打</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> &nbsp;送长辈家人的大牌护肤品，会有很多赠的面膜小样啥的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> &nbsp;日清日化：卫生纸、湿厕纸，买卫生巾送帐篷和露营车和CCD，现在的国货，真是把赠品经济玩明白了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> &nbsp;送各种相机周边，滤镜偏光镜什么的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a> &nbsp;美丽的餐具套装</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;日常送朋友的小伴手礼（茶杯、茶包、文创、文具、护手霜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> &nbsp;狗粮主粮（618买的量正好双十一吃完，然后双十一买的要能覆盖到下一年618）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> &nbsp;厨具换新（其实很多涂层锅的寿命就只有6个月）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> &nbsp;加湿器、取暖器（过冬的东西）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> &nbsp;一次性洗脸巾（单价其实挺高的，又不得不用）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> &nbsp;美瞳/隐形眼镜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> &nbsp;期待一年的包包、电子产品，这时是最后一波降价了，可以适当满足自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> &nbsp;平时没啥这个品类的消费，不过可以分享一下这次在欧洲买奢饰品的退税经验！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> &nbsp;健身卡、攀岩卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> &nbsp;想学很久的知识付费课程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> &nbsp;消费降级：从健身房私教到北大健身房半年600</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> &nbsp;美甲美睫卡，大家可以主动问问自己的各种机构，有没有活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> &nbsp;为了结婚这个（希望是）一生就一次的体验，我还是自愿付费了更多，比如去学习婚礼舞蹈，给婚礼宾客准备一人一份欧舒丹伴手礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> &nbsp;现在家里囤零食、饮料、速食品大大减少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> &nbsp;旅游中完全不买冰箱贴之外的纪念品、明信片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> &nbsp;口红、眼影盘（我2019年买的眼影盘，到现在都没用完）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> &nbsp;手机壳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> &nbsp;各种小摆件、潮玩、装饰用品（我北京家里只有冰箱贴和能升值的拍卖作品，从不买潮玩）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> &nbsp;购物平台推荐：小博主直播间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> &nbsp;购物平台推荐：快团团</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lpYEG1taiCdN-30es8_NXoj499oU.m4a" length="42730218" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDNJLZqZGTmDCaoeZJ4uaJCZk2k.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>123</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>122. 我要攒钱去爬更高的山</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebc094224325ea70def415</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ebc094224325ea70def415</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>食欲做客播客电台【中女Radio】啦！一期有干货有态度的串台🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入卧龙凤雏听友群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 户外攀登，能登顶说明是山接纳了我们，不是我们把山征服了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 8000米以上，全世界只有14座这样的雪山，很多人的梦想是登顶这14座</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> 压垮咱们年轻人的三座山基本就是房子、车子、结婚，我房子、车子都解决了，然后我又不结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 我每段感情都短暂而肤浅，没有必要指望着一个伴侣什么都陪你聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> 每个人只能陪你走一段路，人生中周边的人都是过客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> 我的内核就是我的宗教，它能解决我人生中大部分的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> “所知障“就是你所知道的这些东西其实会成为你的障碍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 很多人羡慕我现在的生活方式，我说你愿意放弃上班给你带来的稳定收入和体面吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 我要有三倍的爬珠峰的钱我才会去爬珠峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 在我看来做自媒体不是一个选项，而是一个必选项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 我现在就是看看哪些东西能赚钱就赚点，赚点钱，然后赶紧去爬山。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3546">59:06</a> 你一旦错过这个机缘了，基本上就错过了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lphl7kNSDG708dHLICVMzyb-Asmu.m4a" length="59635315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:27</itunes:duration>
