    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>食欲串台洪晃老师的播客《歪打正着》啦！双厨狂喜～</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入卧龙凤雏听众群和我们聊天：微信搜wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> &nbsp;从广告公司老板到户外博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> &nbsp;“蔡鸟事件”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> &nbsp;为什么老登精英容易翻车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> &nbsp;四川省甘孜州乡城县然乌乡的“旅游大使”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> &nbsp;“老一代”营销人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> &nbsp;艺术家如何进行商业变现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3142">52:22</a> &nbsp;“哪怕过精英的生活，也要有屌丝一样的思考”</span></p>]]></description>
