    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你知道华莱士是著名的“喷射战士”吗？食欲之前不知道，并为此付出了惨痛的代价...</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入微信群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 食欲今年经历了非常糟糕的登山季</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> 从悬崖上下降，发生降雨差点嘎在悬崖上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 朋友从悬崖另一侧破口大骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 登山前吃喷射战士差点没有熬过下山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 距离登顶只差36米的地方低血糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 当地的师傅只收了三百块就把我和我的装备抬下了山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 男大学生的体能是真好~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 雅姆雪山的最佳登顶期是...</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lrmNBbZGK1gZAZag7yyYPv6x9u-k.m4a" length="25596939" type="audio/mp4"/>
