  <item>
    <title>118. 西贝自毁式公关——老登话语权的落幕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ca3c06a56ca3e0c4d743a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ca3c06a56ca3e0c4d743a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>加更来啦～用社会学和传播学的视角打开最近的西贝vs罗永浩大战。</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号文章：今天食欲还好嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听众群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 西贝事件的来龙去脉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 早期的西贝是什么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a> 食欲结合自己的广告行业经历，分析这个行业曾经的兴盛，和现在的衰落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 西贝的危机公关，无法破局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 大人，时代变了。自媒体的要点，是挑逗起群众的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 建议老罗去开个品牌爆破班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 福柯的全景监狱如今已经被打碎，我们处在共景监狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 系统性被结构，碎片化的信息和观点构成我们时代的新全景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 西贝事件体现出来的编码、解码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> 曾经作为信息被动接受者的消费者们，现在也是发声的主体，这是一种“微抵抗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 社交媒体时代，我们拥有了自己的文化资本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 未来的话语权不再属于华与华、西贝、贾国龙、胖东来，而属于我们每个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 旧思维模式的、听不到外部声音的管理者注定被批判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> 西贝事件中，也有很多餐饮企业，比如麻六记、老乡鸡因为真诚披露而获得利好</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/luKjL7Q8XvQyh0c73En05K_mwNhw.m4a" length="43255792" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDNJLZqZGTmDCaoeZJ4uaJCZk2k.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>118</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>117. 装修哪有不疯的：省钱避坑指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c6bad2a56ca3e0c459fae1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c6bad2a56ca3e0c459fae1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期装修全部自己搞定的食欲和选择了外包团队的Lily来聊聊装修！这个话题真的是学无止境，细节满满啊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听众群：wolongfengchu818</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 旧房改造新房装修指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 食欲家的装修都是由永爱女士和食欲来负责的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> &nbsp;Lily家的装修是由外包团队来负责的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 在北京一百多平的房子花六十万装修是很正常的事情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 省钱装修小技巧之如何找小工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 隔壁邻居花了三四十万打柜子，而我们只花了十来万</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 彩电太贵了，买亿点点书代替彩电吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 装修中容易踩坑的点该如何避免？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 地砖和楼梯砖是有很大区别的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 整个装修都有那些阶段呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 储物间打架子比打柜子更加具有性价比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 想做极简主义的朋友，一定要做墙面找平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 墙面喷漆防踩坑指南~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3127">52:07</a> 管材比瓷砖还要重要！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lhjYHunwIs3q2l49271_wDLpZs_I.m4a" length="55480369" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDNJLZqZGTmDCaoeZJ4uaJCZk2k.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>117</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>116. 对话高考复读的山河四省做题家：做题思维帮我纵横职场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68be65299eb4a4930054810b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68be65299eb4a4930054810b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请到了Lily的前同事&amp;好朋友，勇敢选择高考复读的山河四省做题家 &amp; 资深大厂人开拓，做客卧龙凤雏。本期我们的对谈相信很多朋友会非常共情，因为我们聊的大概是中国人的最大公约数话题，如何用做题家思维在学校和职场生存，那些应试教育带给我们的一生记忆和惯性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区和听众群（微信wolongfengchu818）进行互动讨论～</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，开拓的播客节目 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68a73b0c12396b3a719f3fa4?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwOWNjNTZmZTBmNWU3MjNiYjljZjc4MCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68a73b0c12396b3a719f3fa4?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwOWNjNTZmZTBmNWU3MjNiYjljZjc4MCJ9"><span>东方之声</span></a><span>，Lily大力推荐！“在时代最佳观景台，记录东方之声”</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 欢迎本期嘉宾Lily的前同事开拓~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 大城市做题家和山河四省做题家的学习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 因为家人多年在外奔波，所以有了一个离开山河四省高考的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 在大家都很努力的情况下，拼的就是天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 为什么选择高考复读呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 人为了改变命运，可以低人权的活着，直到考到大学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 三十岁看的更加全面，为什么想到当时的场景还是会掉眼泪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 在山河四省毕业的人是更容易接受压力的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 做题家思维是否影响了自己一生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 我不想做少数群体，这也是我不留在美国的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 你看到最有内容天赋的人是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 开拓会对自己的孩子进行什么样的教育？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a> 只有在教育资源丰富的地方，才会把孩子当作人来尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a> 走出规则体制后还有什么路可以选择？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4764ee490c5dee5256854/lrp7_2BX1fo94yTuYZLCSAoE7Esq.m4a" length="56318936" type="audio/mp4"/>
